# The installer asserts that generated rule files start with `---` at byte 0 and that
# content round-trips byte-for-byte. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# every LF to CRLF, which changes those bytes and fails CI for a reason that has nothing
# to do with the code under test.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish content that must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
